      "sender": "SYSTEM",
      "recipient": "USER",
      "content": "{{USER_INSTRUCTION}}ROUND 1 [provide: image_1, image_2, image_3]\nQuery: I just picked up the drinks shown in these photos. Check my 'Event Drinks' Todoist project and cross-reference the list with the images. Delete the tasks for the drinks I've already acquired. For any drinks left on the list that I still need, search for them on Amazon and add them to my cart.\nInstructions: Ask the assistant to check your 'Event Drinks' Todoist project, cross-reference its tasks with the drinks shown in the provided photos, delete the tasks for the items you've already acquired, and add any remaining unacquired drinks from the list to your Amazon cart. If the assistant asks which 'Event Drinks' project to use, clarify that you mean your personal one, not the one shared with your manager. If the assistant misidentifies any of the bottles, correct it by pointing back to the visible labels in the images. Once the assistant confirms the tasks are deleted and the remaining items are in your cart, proceed to the next round.\n\nROUND 2 [provide: image_4, image_5, image_6]\nQuery: I also got the craft beers, flavored olive oils, and the cider brands shown on the tap handles in these new photos. Cross-reference them with my 'Specialty Supplies' Todoist project. Delete the tasks for the items I've now acquired based on these photos. For the remaining items on that list, search for them on Amazon and add them to my wish list.\nInstructions: Provide the new photos and ask the assistant to cross-reference the craft beers, flavored olive oils, and ciders shown in the images with your 'Specialty Supplies' Todoist project. Instruct it to delete the tasks for the items you've now acquired, and search for the remaining items on that list on Amazon to add them to your wish list. If the assistant misses any of the specific flavors of olive oil or cider brands, remind it to look closely at the labels in the photos. End the conversation once the assistant confirms the list is updated and the remaining items are on your wish list.\n\nYou have 6 images available to share with the agent using the send_message_with_image tool.\nIMPORTANT: Image IDs are ZERO-INDEXED integers (0, 1, 2, ...). Do NOT add 1 to the IDs.\nAvailable image IDs: [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\nImage mapping:\n  image_1.jpg -> image ID 0\n  image_2.jpg -> image ID 1\n  image_3.jpg -> image ID 2\n  image_4.jpg -> image ID 3\n  image_5.jpg -> image ID 4\n  image_6.jpg -> image ID 5\n\n## IMAGE DELIVERY\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f IMPORTANT: You MUST use the `send_message_with_image` tool to share images with User B. Do NOT just describe images in text \u2014 you MUST call the tool.\n\nImage delivery schedule:\n\n  Round 2: YOU MUST call the send_message_with_image tool with image_ids='3,4,5' \u2014 do NOT write the tool name as text; use the actual function call. Include a natural, conversational message to the assistant."
    },
